  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 5.82,
      "e": 7.49,
      "text": "- We're doing this to enhance"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.49,
      "e": 9.7,
      "text": "our firefighters' rescue capabilities"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.7,
      "e": 11.68,
      "text": "in case of an emergency situation"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.68,
      "e": 14.33,
      "text": "and we have to rescue an individual."
    },
    {
      "s": 14.33,
      "e": 16.4,
      "text": "It's our primary job and mission"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.4,
      "e": 18.63,
      "text": "and we want to execute properly."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.63,
      "e": 20.39,
      "text": "- As you can see, set up here,"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.39,
      "e": 23.06,
      "text": "we have hose already deployed out."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.06,
      "e": 25.6,
      "text": "This is to disorient our firefighters."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.6,
      "e": 26.99,
      "text": "During this exercise,"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.99,
      "e": 29.11,
      "text": "we'll have it pitched out black in here"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.11,
      "e": 30.66,
      "text": "and they'll have to overcome more"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.66,
      "e": 34.0,
      "text": "of the obstacle emergency portion of it."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.41,
      "e": 42.38,
      "text": "We have a firefighter placed down at the end of the tent,"
    },
    {
      "s": 42.38,
      "e": 44.49,
      "text": "simulating a downed firefighter."
    },
    {
      "s": 44.49,
      "e": 47.22,
      "text": "It'll be up to the rapid intervention team"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.22,
      "e": 50.38,
      "text": "to come in and get them out, with overcoming"
    },
    {
      "s": 50.38,
      "e": 52.34,
      "text": "all the obstacles."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.34,
      "e": 56.17,
      "text": "(firefighter crying out)"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.17,
      "e": 57.36,
      "text": "- We did three scenarios."
    },
    {
      "s": 57.36,
      "e": 58.93,
      "text": "Me and my partner did really well."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.93,
      "e": 59.97,
      "text": "The other two teams did really well too."
    },
    {
      "s": 59.97,
      "e": 62.74,
      "text": "They blacked us out, just like a real-world scenario."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.74,
      "e": 64.79,
      "text": "It would be blacked out in that tent."
    },
    {
      "s": 64.79,
      "e": 65.89,
      "text": "All these guys, you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.89,
      "e": 66.72,
      "text": "they're real strong guys, you know?"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.72,
      "e": 68.2,
      "text": "They know their job really well."
    },
    {
      "s": 68.2,
      "e": 70.04,
      "text": "They take their job really seriously, you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.04,
      "e": 72.52,
      "text": "just like they have somebody's lives in your hands."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.52,
